February 9-11, 2021
To: PWG Announcements Reflector <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG is holding its February 2021 Virtual Face-to-Face on February 9-11,
2021. This is a "virtual" Face-to-Face event, which means the event will be
held only via Webex teleconference (not Zoom). The PWG February 2021
Virtual Face-to-Face Meeting Page
<https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/february-2021-virtual.html> provides
the event's daily agenda and teleconference information. Any and all
interested parties are invited to attend.

We hope to see you there!

Cheers,
Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/
